WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.750 align:start position:0%
 
[Music]  75 years ago today the ufo era came to  nevada in a dramatic way a military  pilot flying north of lake mead had a  close encounter with an unusual  formation it happened on the afternoon  of june 28 1947 the pilot saw a group of  five or six white circular objects  flying in a tight formation and  traveling at about 285 miles per hour  this came just four days after a more  famous sighting over mount rainier in  washington state that is the case  credited with starting the flying saucer  craze that swept across the country in  june of 1947. author preston dennis says  the military tried to explain away the  lake mead incident but they were in a  triangular formation and much closer  than regulations allow  so this clearly was unusual from the  get-go and as they observed it they saw  that these were not planes at all moving  really fast and uh they ended up  reporting this officially  and uh i believe  there's only four cases that actually  were declared unidentified by blue book  the lake mead incident is one of dozens  of notable ufo cases over nevada 8 news  now i-team reporter george knapp put  together a detailed history of the  nevada ufo incidents you can see those  on mysterywire.com

